## Before handing the bundle back

1. Confirm every page listed in `content/pages.json` still exists at the bundle root.
2. Confirm each page has exactly one `#content` root and its matching `section[data-section-id]`.
3. Search for duplicate or missing `data-id` values.
4. Confirm page images resolve from `images/`.
5. Confirm no custom or remote stylesheets and no custom external scripts were added.
6. Zip the contents of this directory without introducing another internal layout.

ADT Studio performs the same checks during import and will explain any incompatibility instead of trying to guess how a custom structure should map back into the pipeline.
